{Session 5: The Pharmacopornographic Regime AKA How Aligned Is That Dildo?
The following is an exploration of the concept of the pharmacopornographic regime, coined by B Preciado, author of Testo Junkie.}

Endorphin enters the housing suite where David Foster Wallace and Ovid took a two week rest to assemble the final draft of their article on the NeurIPS conference.
He had heard from OVID via his first ever email, of which Endorphin was quite proud of OVID for doing on his own. The email, however, was one of worry. "Endless processings of boxes, and the nonsense of wires and casings and magical functions they seem to have, even more so when put together. When I asked DFW what he was doing with that equipment, he said, "doing my part to make this weird ass cognitive magic mirror slash electron microscope slash James Webb telescopes for the human mind finally understandable, its decisions traceable."
{David Foster Wallace describes how he came to be enamored with interpretability research, its potential for a fine craft exactness that might birth the new version of the Venetian studio system, a Bauhaus for the regions beyond the Boolean.}

